{"page":393,"verses":[{"verse_key":"28:60","surah":28,"ayah":60,"ar_uthmani":"وَمَآ أُوتِيتُم مِّن شَىْءٍ فَمَتَـٰعُ ٱلْحَيَوٰةِ ٱلدُّنْيَا وَزِينَتُهَا ۚ وَمَا عِندَ ٱللَّهِ خَيْرٌ وَأَبْقَىٰٓ ۚ أَفَلَا تَعْقِلُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Whatever things you have been given for the life of this world are merely [temporary] gratification and vanity: that which is with God is better and more lasting- will you not use your reason?","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَمَآ","en_gloss":"And whatever","transliteration":"wamā","verse_key":"28:60"},{"pos":2,"ar":"أُوتِيتُم","en_gloss":"you have been given","transliteration":"ūtītum","verse_key":"28:60"},{"pos":3,"ar":"مِّن","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"28:60"},{"pos":4,"ar":"شَىْءٍۢ","en_gloss":"things","transliteration":"shayin","verse_key":"28:60"},{"pos":5,"ar":"فَمَتَـٰعُ","en_gloss":"(is) an enjoyment","transliteration":"famatāʿu","verse_key":"28:60"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱلْحَيَوٰةِ","en_gloss":"(of the) life","transliteration":"l-ḥayati","verse_key":"28:60"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱلدُّنْيَا","en_gloss":"(of) the world","transliteration":"l-dun'yā","verse_key":"28:60"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَزِينَتُهَا ۚ","en_gloss":"and its adornment","transliteration":"wazīnatuhā","verse_key":"28:60"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَمَا","en_gloss":"And what","transliteration":"wamā","verse_key":"28:60"},{"pos":10,"ar":"عِندَ","en_gloss":"(is) with","transliteration":"ʿinda","verse_key":"28:60"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"28:60"},{"pos":12,"ar":"خَيْرٌۭ","en_gloss":"(is) better","transliteration":"khayrun","verse_key":"28:60"},{"pos":13,"ar":"وَأَبْقَىٰٓ ۚ","en_gloss":"and more lasting","transliteration":"wa-abqā","verse_key":"28:60"},{"pos":14,"ar":"أَفَلَا","en_gloss":"So (will) not","transliteration":"afalā","verse_key":"28:60"},{"pos":15,"ar":"تَعْقِلُونَ","en_gloss":"you use intellect","transliteration":"taʿqilūna","verse_key":"28:60"},{"pos":16,"ar":"٦٠","en_gloss":"(60)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"28:60"}]},{"verse_key":"28:61","surah":28,"ayah":61,"ar_uthmani":"أَفَمَن وَعَدْنَـٰهُ وَعْدًا حَسَنًا فَهُوَ لَـٰقِيهِ كَمَن مَّتَّعْنَـٰهُ مَتَـٰعَ ٱلْحَيَوٰةِ ٱلدُّنْيَا ثُمَّ هُوَ يَوْمَ ٱلْقِيَـٰمَةِ مِنَ ٱلْمُحْضَرِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Can the person who will see the fulfilment of the good promise We gave him be compared to someone We have given some enjoyments for this worldly life but who, on the Day of Resurrection, will be summoned?","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"أَفَمَن","en_gloss":"Then is (he) whom","transliteration":"afaman","verse_key":"28:61"},{"pos":2,"ar":"وَعَدْنَـٰهُ","en_gloss":"We have promised him","transliteration":"waʿadnāhu","verse_key":"28:61"},{"pos":3,"ar":"وَعْدًا","en_gloss":"a promise","transliteration":"waʿdan","verse_key":"28:61"},{"pos":4,"ar":"حَسَنًۭا","en_gloss":"good","transliteration":"ḥasanan","verse_key":"28:61"},{"pos":5,"ar":"فَهُوَ","en_gloss":"and he","transliteration":"fahuwa","verse_key":"28:61"},{"pos":6,"ar":"لَـٰقِيهِ","en_gloss":"(will) meet it","transliteration":"lāqīhi","verse_key":"28:61"},{"pos":7,"ar":"كَمَن","en_gloss":"like (the one) whom","transliteration":"kaman","verse_key":"28:61"},{"pos":8,"ar":"مَّتَّعْنَـٰهُ","en_gloss":"We provided him","transliteration":"mattaʿnāhu","verse_key":"28:61"},{"pos":9,"ar":"مَتَـٰعَ","en_gloss":"enjoyment","transliteration":"matāʿa","verse_key":"28:61"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ٱلْحَيَوٰةِ","en_gloss":"(of the) life","transliteration":"l-ḥayati","verse_key":"28:61"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱلدُّنْيَا","en_gloss":"(of) the world","transliteration":"l-dun'yā","verse_key":"28:61"},{"pos":12,"ar":"ثُمَّ","en_gloss":"then","transliteration":"thumma","verse_key":"28:61"},{"pos":13,"ar":"هُوَ","en_gloss":"he","transliteration":"huwa","verse_key":"28:61"},{"pos":14,"ar":"يَوْمَ","en_gloss":"(on the) Day","transliteration":"yawma","verse_key":"28:61"},{"pos":15,"ar":"ٱلْقِيَـٰمَةِ","en_gloss":"(of) the Resurrection","transliteration":"l-qiyāmati","verse_key":"28:61"},{"pos":16,"ar":"مِنَ","en_gloss":"(will be) among","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"28:61"},{"pos":17,"ar":"ٱلْمُحْضَرِينَ","en_gloss":"those presented","transliteration":"l-muḥ'ḍarīna","verse_key":"28:61"},{"pos":18,"ar":"٦١","en_gloss":"(61)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"28:61"}]},{"verse_key":"28:62","surah":28,"ayah":62,"ar_uthmani":"وَيَوْمَ يُنَادِيهِمْ فَيَقُولُ أَيْنَ شُرَكَآءِىَ ٱلَّذِينَ كُنتُمْ تَزْعُمُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"The Day will come when God will call them, saying, ‘Where now are those you allege are My partners?’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَيَوْمَ","en_gloss":"And (the) Day","transliteration":"wayawma","verse_key":"28:62"},{"pos":2,"ar":"يُنَادِيهِمْ","en_gloss":"He will call them","transliteration":"yunādīhim","verse_key":"28:62"},{"pos":3,"ar":"فَيَقُولُ","en_gloss":"and say","transliteration":"fayaqūlu","verse_key":"28:62"},{"pos":4,"ar":"أَيْنَ","en_gloss":"Where","transliteration":"ayna","verse_key":"28:62"},{"pos":5,"ar":"شُرَكَآءِىَ","en_gloss":"(are) My partners","transliteration":"shurakāiya","verse_key":"28:62"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"whom","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"28:62"},{"pos":7,"ar":"كُنتُمْ","en_gloss":"you used (to)","transliteration":"kuntum","verse_key":"28:62"},{"pos":8,"ar":"تَزْعُمُونَ","en_gloss":"claim","transliteration":"tazʿumūna","verse_key":"28:62"},{"pos":9,"ar":"٦٢","en_gloss":"(62)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"28:62"}]},{"verse_key":"28:63","surah":28,"ayah":63,"ar_uthmani":"قَالَ ٱلَّذِينَ حَقَّ عَلَيْهِمُ ٱلْقَوْلُ رَبَّنَا هَـٰٓؤُلَآءِ ٱلَّذِينَ أَغْوَيْنَآ أَغْوَيْنَـٰهُمْ كَمَا غَوَيْنَا ۖ تَبَرَّأْنَآ إِلَيْكَ ۖ مَا كَانُوٓا۟ إِيَّانَا يَعْبُدُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"and those [ringleaders] against whom the verdict will be passed will say, ‘Our Lord, these are the ones we caused to deviate. We caused them to deviate as we ourselves deviated, but now we disown them before You: they did not really serve us.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"قَالَ","en_gloss":"(Will) say","transliteration":"qāla","verse_key":"28:63"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those ","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"28:63"},{"pos":3,"ar":"حَقَّ","en_gloss":"(has) come true","transliteration":"ḥaqqa","verse_key":"28:63"},{"pos":4,"ar":"عَلَيْهِمُ","en_gloss":"against whom","transliteration":"ʿalayhimu","verse_key":"28:63"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱلْقَوْلُ","en_gloss":"the Word","transliteration":"l-qawlu","verse_key":"28:63"},{"pos":6,"ar":"رَبَّنَا","en_gloss":"Our Lord","transliteration":"rabbanā","verse_key":"28:63"},{"pos":7,"ar":"هَـٰٓؤُلَآءِ","en_gloss":"These","transliteration":"hāulāi","verse_key":"28:63"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"(are) those whom","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"28:63"},{"pos":9,"ar":"أَغْوَيْنَآ","en_gloss":"we led astray","transliteration":"aghwaynā","verse_key":"28:63"},{"pos":10,"ar":"أَغْوَيْنَـٰهُمْ","en_gloss":"We led them astray","transliteration":"aghwaynāhum","verse_key":"28:63"},{"pos":11,"ar":"كَمَا","en_gloss":"as","transliteration":"kamā","verse_key":"28:63"},{"pos":12,"ar":"غَوَيْنَا ۖ","en_gloss":"we were astray","transliteration":"ghawaynā","verse_key":"28:63"},{"pos":13,"ar":"تَبَرَّأْنَآ","en_gloss":"We declare our innocence","transliteration":"tabarranā","verse_key":"28:63"},{"pos":14,"ar":"إِلَيْكَ ۖ","en_gloss":"before You","transliteration":"ilayka","verse_key":"28:63"},{"pos":15,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"Not","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"28:63"},{"pos":16,"ar":"كَانُوٓا۟","en_gloss":"they used (to)","transliteration":"kānū","verse_key":"28:63"},{"pos":17,"ar":"إِيَّانَا","en_gloss":"worship us","transliteration":"iyyānā","verse_key":"28:63"},{"pos":18,"ar":"يَعْبُدُونَ","en_gloss":"worship us","transliteration":"yaʿbudūna","verse_key":"28:63"},{"pos":19,"ar":"٦٣","en_gloss":"(63)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"28:63"}]},{"verse_key":"28:64","surah":28,"ayah":64,"ar_uthmani":"وَقِيلَ ٱدْعُوا۟ شُرَكَآءَكُمْ فَدَعَوْهُمْ فَلَمْ يَسْتَجِيبُوا۟ لَهُمْ وَرَأَوُا۟ ٱلْعَذَابَ ۚ لَوْ أَنَّهُمْ كَانُوا۟ يَهْتَدُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"It will then be said to them, ‘Now call those you worshipped as partners,’ and they will call them but receive no answer. They will see the suffering and wish they had followed guidance.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَقِيلَ","en_gloss":"And it will be said","transliteration":"waqīla","verse_key":"28:64"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱدْعُوا۟","en_gloss":"Call","transliteration":"id'ʿū","verse_key":"28:64"},{"pos":3,"ar":"شُرَكَآءَكُمْ","en_gloss":"your partners","transliteration":"shurakāakum","verse_key":"28:64"},{"pos":4,"ar":"فَدَعَوْهُمْ","en_gloss":"And they will call them","transliteration":"fadaʿawhum","verse_key":"28:64"},{"pos":5,"ar":"فَلَمْ","en_gloss":"but not","transliteration":"falam","verse_key":"28:64"},{"pos":6,"ar":"يَسْتَجِيبُوا۟","en_gloss":"they will respond","transliteration":"yastajībū","verse_key":"28:64"},{"pos":7,"ar":"لَهُمْ","en_gloss":"to them","transliteration":"lahum","verse_key":"28:64"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَرَأَوُا۟","en_gloss":"and they will see","transliteration":"wara-awū","verse_key":"28:64"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱلْعَذَابَ ۚ","en_gloss":"the punishment","transliteration":"l-ʿadhāba","verse_key":"28:64"},{"pos":10,"ar":"لَوْ","en_gloss":"If only","transliteration":"law","verse_key":"28:64"},{"pos":11,"ar":"أَنَّهُمْ","en_gloss":"[that] they","transliteration":"annahum","verse_key":"28:64"},{"pos":12,"ar":"كَانُوا۟","en_gloss":"had been","transliteration":"kānū","verse_key":"28:64"},{"pos":13,"ar":"يَهْتَدُونَ","en_gloss":"guided","transliteration":"yahtadūna","verse_key":"28:64"},{"pos":14,"ar":"٦٤","en_gloss":"(64)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"28:64"}]},{"verse_key":"28:65","surah":28,"ayah":65,"ar_uthmani":"وَيَوْمَ يُنَادِيهِمْ فَيَقُولُ مَاذَآ أَجَبْتُمُ ٱلْمُرْسَلِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"On that Day He will call them, saying, ‘How did you respond to My messengers?’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَيَوْمَ","en_gloss":"And (the) Day","transliteration":"wayawma","verse_key":"28:65"},{"pos":2,"ar":"يُنَادِيهِمْ","en_gloss":"He will call them","transliteration":"yunādīhim","verse_key":"28:65"},{"pos":3,"ar":"فَيَقُولُ","en_gloss":"and say","transliteration":"fayaqūlu","verse_key":"28:65"},{"pos":4,"ar":"مَاذَآ","en_gloss":"What","transliteration":"mādhā","verse_key":"28:65"},{"pos":5,"ar":"أَجَبْتُمُ","en_gloss":"did you answer","transliteration":"ajabtumu","verse_key":"28:65"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱلْمُرْسَلِينَ","en_gloss":"the Messengers","transliteration":"l-mur'salīna","verse_key":"28:65"},{"pos":7,"ar":"٦٥","en_gloss":"(65)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"28:65"}]},{"verse_key":"28:66","surah":28,"ayah":66,"ar_uthmani":"فَعَمِيَتْ عَلَيْهِمُ ٱلْأَنۢبَآءُ يَوْمَئِذٍ فَهُمْ لَا يَتَسَآءَلُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"All arguments will seem obscure to them on that Day; they will not be able to consult one another.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"فَعَمِيَتْ","en_gloss":"But (will) be obscure","transliteration":"faʿamiyat","verse_key":"28:66"},{"pos":2,"ar":"عَلَيْهِمُ","en_gloss":"to them","transliteration":"ʿalayhimu","verse_key":"28:66"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلْأَنۢبَآءُ","en_gloss":"the information","transliteration":"l-anbāu","verse_key":"28:66"},{"pos":4,"ar":"يَوْمَئِذٍۢ","en_gloss":"that day","transliteration":"yawma-idhin","verse_key":"28:66"},{"pos":5,"ar":"فَهُمْ","en_gloss":"so they","transliteration":"fahum","verse_key":"28:66"},{"pos":6,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"will not ask one another","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"28:66"},{"pos":7,"ar":"يَتَسَآءَلُونَ","en_gloss":"will not ask one another","transliteration":"yatasāalūna","verse_key":"28:66"},{"pos":8,"ar":"٦٦","en_gloss":"(66)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"28:66"}]},{"verse_key":"28:67","surah":28,"ayah":67,"ar_uthmani":"فَأَمَّا مَن تَابَ وَءَامَنَ وَعَمِلَ صَـٰلِحًا فَعَسَىٰٓ أَن يَكُونَ مِنَ ٱلْمُفْلِحِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Yet anyone who has repented, believed, and done good deeds can hope to find himself among the successful.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"فَأَمَّا","en_gloss":"But as for","transliteration":"fa-ammā","verse_key":"28:67"},{"pos":2,"ar":"مَن","en_gloss":"(him) who","transliteration":"man","verse_key":"28:67"},{"pos":3,"ar":"تَابَ","en_gloss":"repented","transliteration":"tāba","verse_key":"28:67"},{"pos":4,"ar":"وَءَامَنَ","en_gloss":"and believed","transliteration":"waāmana","verse_key":"28:67"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَعَمِلَ","en_gloss":"and did","transliteration":"waʿamila","verse_key":"28:67"},{"pos":6,"ar":"صَـٰلِحًۭا","en_gloss":"righteousness","transliteration":"ṣāliḥan","verse_key":"28:67"},{"pos":7,"ar":"فَعَسَىٰٓ","en_gloss":"then perhaps","transliteration":"faʿasā","verse_key":"28:67"},{"pos":8,"ar":"أَن","en_gloss":"[that]","transliteration":"an","verse_key":"28:67"},{"pos":9,"ar":"يَكُونَ","en_gloss":"he will be","transliteration":"yakūna","verse_key":"28:67"},{"pos":10,"ar":"مِنَ","en_gloss":"of","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"28:67"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱلْمُفْلِحِينَ","en_gloss":"the successful ones","transliteration":"l-muf'liḥīna","verse_key":"28:67"},{"pos":12,"ar":"٦٧","en_gloss":"(67)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"28:67"}]},{"verse_key":"28:68","surah":28,"ayah":68,"ar_uthmani":"وَرَبُّكَ يَخْلُقُ مَا يَشَآءُ وَيَخْتَارُ ۗ مَا كَانَ لَهُمُ ٱلْخِيَرَةُ ۚ سُبْحَـٰنَ ٱللَّهِ وَتَعَـٰلَىٰ عَمَّا يُشْرِكُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Your Lord creates what He pleases and chooses those He will- they have no choice- so glory be to God, and may He be exalted above the partners they ascribe to Him!","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَرَبُّكَ","en_gloss":"And your Lord","transliteration":"warabbuka","verse_key":"28:68"},{"pos":2,"ar":"يَخْلُقُ","en_gloss":"creates","transliteration":"yakhluqu","verse_key":"28:68"},{"pos":3,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"what","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"28:68"},{"pos":4,"ar":"يَشَآءُ","en_gloss":"He wills","transliteration":"yashāu","verse_key":"28:68"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَيَخْتَارُ ۗ","en_gloss":"and chooses","transliteration":"wayakhtā